@nergous/dsh-telegram-bridge README · Set up：Only one process may poll a bot. If DSH desktop and `dsh web` run at the same
time with this plugin, Telegram answers `409 Conflict`; use one of them, or a
second bot.

@nergous/dsh-telegram-bridge README · Topic commands：Other DSH slash commands, such as `/goal`, run through the
DSH command registry like in the composer. Unknown slash text is sent to the
session as a message.

@nergous/dsh-telegram-bridge README · Settings：DSH speech-to-text (`@deepseek-ai/dsh-experimental-voice-input-bundle`) is
optional and does not recognize Russian; for Russian voice messages set a
transcription command such as whisper.cpp.
